---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SectionHead from '../components/SectionHead.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config';
---

<Base title="About" description={`About ${SITE.name}.`}>
  <p class="eyebrow">Hello</p>
  <h1>About</h1>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      Hi, I'm <strong>{SITE.fullName}</strong>, a cybersecurity student in Melbourne who used to be a
      software engineer.
    </p>
    <p>
      I started out building software. At Torry Harris in Bengaluru I built Spring Boot microservices from
      scratch, wrote the tests that kept them honest, and put together GenAI prototypes on LangChain with
      OpenAI, Mistral and Llama. That gave me a builder's view of how modern applications fit together,
      and of all the places where they come apart.
    </p>
    <p>
      That second part is what pulled me into security. In 2025 I moved to Melbourne to do a Master's in
      Cyber Security at RMIT, focusing on attack analysis, incident response, cryptography and privacy in
      machine learning. Outside class I practise on HackTheBox and in my own SIEM home lab, and I'm
      studying for CompTIA Security+. I'm also a DevSecOps intern at XSPECTRE, auditing
      access control and fixing pipelines.
    </p>

    <!--
      ✏️ Make this yours. A short paragraph about you outside work: what you do on weekends,
      what got you into computers, a weird fact. That's what makes people remember you.
    -->

    <h2>What I'm looking for</h2>
    <p>
      Graduate or entry-level blue team roles in Australia: <strong>SOC Analyst</strong>,
      <strong>DFIR Analyst</strong>, <strong>Threat Hunter</strong> or <strong>Detection Engineer</strong>,
      starting December 2026 or early 2027.
    </p>
    <blockquote>{SITE.closing}</blockquote>
  </div>

  <SectionHead title="Get in touch" />
  <ul class="contact">
    {SITE.email && <li><span>email</span><a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a></li>}
    {
      SITE.socials.map((s) => (
        <li>
          <span>{s.label.toLowerCase()}</span>
          <a href={s.href}>{s.href.replace(/^https?:\/\/(www\.)?/, '')}</a>
        </li>
      ))
    }
    <li><span>based</span>{SITE.location}</li>
  </ul>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose {
    max-width: 64ch;
  }
  .prose strong {
    color: #eef2f8;
  }
  .contact {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .contact li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 6rem 1fr;
    padding: 0.25rem 0;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .contact span {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
</style>
